#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/vmware/getting_started.rst:2
msgid "Getting Started"
msgstr "Primeros pasos"

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/vmware/getting_started.rst:4
msgid ""
"To get started with VMware, simply start by adding a Cloud in the "
"``Infrastructure > Clouds`` section."
msgstr ""
"To get started con VMware, simply start by adding un Cloud in el "
"``Infrastructure > Clouds`` sección."

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/vmware/getting_started.rst:6
msgid "To start adding a VMware cloud there will be some things you will need:"
msgstr "To start adding un VMware cloud allí será be algunos things you será need:"

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/vmware/getting_started.rst:8
msgid "vCenter API Url"
msgstr "vCenter API Url"

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/vmware/getting_started.rst:9
msgid ""
"Typically this is the url to the vCenter web client with a ``/sdk`` in "
"the path"
msgstr ""
"Típicamente este es el url to el vCenter web client con un ``/sdk`` in el"
" ruta"

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/vmware/getting_started.rst:10
msgid "Username/Password"
msgstr "Username/Password"

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/vmware/getting_started.rst:11
msgid ""
"A set of credentials with high level access to VMware (ensure the account"
" has Datacenter level access)"
msgstr ""
"A set of credentials con high level acceso to VMware (ensure el cuenta "
"tiene Datacenter level acceso)"

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/vmware/getting_started.rst:13
msgid ""
"Once these fields are entered, some selections will start pre-populating."
" A cloud integration is scoped to a specific data center, and can "
"optionally be scoped down to a single cluster or even a single resource "
"pool. If the drop downs do not populate, please verify the api url is "
"resolvable, morpheus has access to vCenter on 443, and the provided "
"credentials are correct and the user has sufficient permissions."
msgstr ""
"Once estos campos son entered, algunos selections será start pre-"
"populating. A cloud integration es scoped to un específico datos center, "
"y puede opcionalmente be scoped down to un único cluster o incluso un "
"único recurso pool. If el drop downs no populate, please verify el api "
"url es resolvable, morpheus tiene acceso to vCenter on 443, y el provided"
" credentials son correct y el usuario tiene sufficient permisos."

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/vmware/getting_started.rst:15
msgid ""
"Another cool feature provided with the cloud integration is optional "
"`Resource Pool` scoping. One can choose to allow the cloud to provision "
"into All Resource Pools or a singular Resource Pool. When choosing `All`,"
" these Resource Pools can be managed from a sub-account and visibility "
"perspective via the Cloud Detail page (multi-tenancy)."
msgstr ""
"Another cool característica provided con la nube integration es opcional "
"`Resource Pool` scoping. One puede choose to allow la nube to provision "
"en All Resource Pools o un singular Resource Pool. When choosing `All`, "
"estos Resource Pools se puede administrar desde un sub-cuenta y "
"visibility perspective via el Cloud Detail página (multi-tenancy)."

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/vmware/getting_started.rst:17
msgid ""
"The VMware cloud integration provides a few additional options including "
"allowing users to make host selections or keeping that aspect hidden such"
" that the best host is automatically chosen for the requested provision."
msgstr ""
"The VMware cloud integration provides un few adicional opciones including"
" allowing users to make host selections o keeping que aspect hidden such "
"que el best host es automáticamente chosen para el requested provision."

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/vmware/getting_started.rst:19
msgid ""
"The *RPC Mode* feature can be configured to allow |morpheus| to install "
"its agent on the Guest operating system via either SSH/WinRM or Vmware "
"Tools Guest Process feature. The VMware tools Guest Execution API can be "
"tricky so it is recommended to use SSH/WinRM if possible. However, if it "
"is not possible for the Appliance to have outbound access to all networks"
" in which VMs are being provisioned to the SSH/WinRM ports (22, 5985 "
"respectively) then Guest Execution is the only option."
msgstr ""
"The *RPC Mode* característica se puede configurar to allow |morpheus| to "
"install its agent on el Guest operating sistema via either SSH/WinRM o "
"Vmware Tools Guest Process característica. The VMware tools Guest "
"Execution API puede be tricky so it es recomendado to use SSH/WinRM if "
"possible. Sin embargo, if it no es possible para el Appliance to tienen "
"outbound acceso to todos networks in cual VMs son being provisioned to el"
" SSH/WinRM ports (22, 5985 respectively) entonces Guest Execution es el "
"solo opción."

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/vmware/getting_started.rst:21
msgid ""
"The `Use VNC` console option on the VMware cloud requires special "
"configuration on each ESXI host but allowed hypervisor level remote "
"console support. (See the Advanced Section for details)"
msgstr ""
"The `Use VNC` console opción on el VMware cloud requires special "
"configuración on cada ESXI host pero allowed hypervisor level remoto "
"console support. (See el Advanced Section para detalles)"

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/vmware/getting_started.rst:23
msgid ""
"When following this add cloud wizard an option will be presented to "
"create a group or add to an existing group. These groups can be given "
"provisioning permission via  role based access control. It is normally "
"recommended that groups are organized such that one cloud exists in one "
"group unless the networks are setup such that internal routing is "
"possible between the clouds. This is very useful for bursting, or hybrid "
"cloud configurations."
msgstr ""
"When following este add cloud wizard un opción será be presented to "
"create un grupo o add to un existente group. These groups puede be given "
"provisioning permiso via  role based acceso control. It es normalmente "
"recomendado que groups son organized such que one cloud exists in one "
"group unless la reds son setup such que interno routing es possible entre"
" la nubes. This es muy useful para bursting, o hybrid cloud "
"configurations."

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/vmware/getting_started.rst:26
msgid "Windows Provisioning Tips"
msgstr "Windows Provisioning Tips"

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/vmware/getting_started.rst:28
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"By default when provisioning windows templates, |morpheus| performs guest"
" customizations which initiates a sysprep. This resets the Administrator "
"user and password. |morpheus| will set the Administrator password from "
":menuselection:`Administration --> Settings --> Provisioning` > Windows "
"Settings > Password."
msgstr ""
"By predeterminado cuando provisioning windows templates, |morpheus| "
"performs guest customizations cual initiates un sysprep. This resets el "
"Administrator user y contraseña. |morpheus| será set el Administrator "
"contraseña desde |AdmSetPro| > Windows Settings > Password."

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/vmware/getting_started.rst:30
msgid ""
"Users can also set the username on an image as Administrator and enter a "
"different password if unique passwords are required per image."
msgstr ""
"Users puede también set el usuarioname on un image as Administrator y "
"enter un diferente contraseña if unique passwords son requerido per "
"image."

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/vmware/getting_started.rst:32
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Guest customizations are required when assigning static IP's manually or "
"using IP pools. They can be disabled per virtual image advanced settings "
"under :menuselection:`Library --> Virtual Images` > Edit Image > Advanced"
" > Uncheck \"Force Guest Customization\" if using DHCP. However the SID "
"will not be changed from the source template. In addition, new VM's will "
"not be able to join a domain that had already been joined by the source "
"template or any other VM's with that SID."
msgstr ""
"Guest customizations son requerido cuando assigning static IP's "
"manualmente o using IP pools. They se puede deshabilitar per virtual "
"image advanced configuración under |LibVir| > Edit Image > Advanced > "
"Uncheck \"Force Guest Customization\" if using DHCP. Sin embargo el SID "
"no be cambiado desde el origen template. Además, nuevo VM's no be able to"
" join un domain que tenía ya sido joined by el origen template o "
"cualquier otro VM's con que SID."

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/vmware/getting_started.rst:35
msgid "Existing Instances"
msgstr "Existing Instances"

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/vmware/getting_started.rst:37
msgid ""
"|morpheus| provides several features regarding pulling in existing "
"virtual machines and servers in an environment. Most cloud options "
"contain a checkbox titled '*Inventory Existing Instances*'. When this "
"option is selected, all VMs found within the specified scope of the cloud"
" integration will be scanned periodically and Virtual Machines will be "
"synced into |morpheus|. Users may also choose to onboard only virtual "
"machines that are running within specific Resource Pools. Once the "
"vCenter Cloud is integrated, navigate to the detail page for the specific"
" Cloud (select it from the list at |InfClo|). From the Resources tab, "
"locate the Pools section. Click ACTIONS > Edit next to a selected "
"Resource Pool. If INVENTORY is checked, |morpheus| will automatically "
"onboard virtual machines from that Resource Pool."
msgstr ""
"|morpheus| provides several características regarding pulling in "
"existente virtual machines y servers in un entorno. Most cloud opciones "
"contain un casilla de verificación titled '*Inventory Existing "
"Instances*'. When este opción es seleccionado, todos VMs found dentro de "
"el especificado scope of la nube integration será be scanned periodically"
" y Virtual Machines será be synced en |morpheus|. Users puede también "
"choose to onboard solo virtual machines que son running dentro de "
"específico Resource Pools. Once el vCenter Cloud es integrated, navigate "
"to el página de detalles para el específico Cloud (select it desde el "
"lista at |InfClo|). Desde el Resources pestaña, locate el Pools sección. "
"Click ACTIONS > Edit siguiente to un seleccionado Resource Pool. If "
"INVENTORY es checked, |morpheus| será automáticamente onboard virtual "
"machines desde que Resource Pool."

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/vmware/getting_started.rst:39
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"By default these virtual machines are considered 'unmanaged' and do not "
"appear in the :menuselection:`Provisioning --> Instances` area but rather"
" ``Infrastructure > Compute > Virtual Machines``. However, a few features"
" are provided with regards to unmanaged instances. They can be assigned "
"to various accounts if using a multitenant master account, however it may"
" be best suited to instead assign the 'Resource Pool' to an account and "
"optionally move all servers with regards to that pool (more on this "
"later)."
msgstr ""
"By predeterminado estos virtual machines son considered 'unmanaged' y no "
"appear in el |ProIns| area pero rather ``Infrastructure > Compute > "
"Virtual Machines``. Sin embargo, un few características son provided con "
"regards to unmanaged instances. They puede be assigned to various "
"accounts if using un multitenant master cuenta, sin embargo it puede be "
"best suited to en cambio assign el 'Resource Pool' to un cuenta y "
"opcionalmente move todos servers con regards to que pool (más on este "
"later)."

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/vmware/getting_started.rst:41
msgid ""
"A server can also be made into a managed server. During this process "
"remote access is requested and an agent install is performed on the guest"
" operating system. This allows for guest operations regarding log "
"acquisition and stats. If the agent install fails, a server will still be"
" marked as managed and an Instance will be created in `Provisioning`, "
"however certain features will not function. This includes stats "
"collection and logs."
msgstr ""
"A server puede también be made en un managed server. During este proceso "
"remoto acceso es requested y un agente install es performed on el guest "
"operating sistema. This allows para guest operaciones regarding log "
"acquisition y stats. If el agente install fails, un servidor será aún be "
"marked as managed y un Instance será creado in `Provisioning`, sin "
"embargo certain características no función. This includes stats "
"collection y logs."

