"later."
msgstr ""
"Create un nuevo virtual machine in VMware vCenter y install un base "
"versión of your preferred Linux build. You debe be running ESXi 6.7 "
"Update 2 o later."

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/vmware/vmware_templates.rst:119
